              "message": "Write a LinkedIn B2B post directly targeting OnlyFans Management Agencies using the PAS (Problem-Agitation-Solution) framework based on the provided topic.\n\nPosition Tuppli as the ultimate autonomous 'Iron Dome' for their roster."
